msgid "Permanently delete"
msgstr "Supprimer définitivement"

#: members/templates/members/admin_update.html
msgid "Delete this member"
msgstr "Supprimer ce membre"

#: members/templates/members/admin_update.html
msgid "Deleting archives the member and disables their login. Their history is kept until they are purged."
msgstr "La suppression archive le membre et désactive son accès. Son historique est conservé jusqu'à la purge."

